<mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Assumptions &amp;amp; unknowns&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Not visible in the repo: variable-group contents (azure-devops-pipeline-network-apps, azure-devops-pipeline-terraform-drift, Wiz-CI-CD-API-Keys), branch policies / PR validation, how the storage account was created.&lt;br&gt;Azure DevOps is inferred from .azure/pipelines YAML. Grafana data sources, team IDs (&quot;1:xx&quot;) and most folder UIDs are literal values created outside Terraform. Jira credentials come from the drift variable group.&lt;br&gt;SECURITY: provider.tf (2 access tokens) and contact-points.tf (18 Opsgenie API keys) hold literal secrets in code - values are intentionally omitted from these diagrams." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=9.5;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="757" width="1129" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
