<mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Assumptions &amp;amp; unknowns&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Backend and providers are separate: the backend only stores state; providers create resources. azurerm appears in both the backend block and (unused) as a provider, which can look like one thing.&lt;br&gt;Grafana provider tokens are literal strings in provider.tf, not pipeline variables; Azure credentials (ARM_*) come from Azure DevOps variable groups outside the repo. Terraform is pinned to 1.5.5.&lt;br&gt;SECURITY: literal secrets exist in config/terraform/provider.tf and app/stacks/Grafana-Prod/contact-points.tf (values omitted). Provider endpoints &quot;default&quot; are provider behaviour, not set in this code." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=9.5;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="757" width="1129" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
