<mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Assumptions &amp;amp; unknowns&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Solid arrow: the folder_uid literal in dashboards.tf equals a literal in a grafana_folder_permission resource (modules/folders), and the title is taken from var.folders. Thick: explicit Terraform reference. Dashed: name match only.&lt;br&gt;UIDs in dashboards.tf and modules/folders are hard-coded strings with no code link between them. Observations are leads for a human to verify in Grafana, not confirmed defects. File-level detail is on page 4b.&lt;br&gt;Dashboards are matched with fileset(&quot;teams/&amp;lt;team&amp;gt;/dashboards/json&quot;, &quot;*.json&quot;): non-recursive, so files in subfolders are skipped." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=9.5;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1099" width="1614" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
