<mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Assumptions &amp;amp; unknowns&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Names are taken verbatim from the repo (including spaces, typos such as &quot;perfomance&quot; and &quot;Repotrs&quot;, and &quot;copy&quot; files). Second line of each card = destination folder title (inferred, see page 4).&lt;br&gt;merchant-portal: both JSON files live in teams/merchant-portal/dashboard/ while main.tf reads dashboards/json, so neither is matched (to verify). light-speed-gateway: the old-dashboards-backup/ file is skipped by the non-recursive fileset.&lt;br&gt;Duplicate titles seen across folders (not necessarily problems): &quot;Jackpot Payouts&quot;, &quot;Kiosk Logs&quot;, &quot;Property Health&quot;, &quot;LSG &amp;amp; PCA - Resources&quot;; same-folder duplicate: &quot;VIPC Statistics&quot; in vip-connect." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=9.5;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1099" width="1614" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
