<mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Assumptions &amp;amp; unknowns&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Solid arrows are written in .azure/pipelines (manual.yml, nightly.yml) or backend/provider config. Dashed arrows (state read/write, API refresh, create/update) are standard Terraform and azurerm-backend behaviour not spelled out in the repo.&lt;br&gt;External or unknown: ARM_* values (Azure DevOps variable groups), branch policies, who may approve beyond the YAML user list, and Jira credentials. State-blob locking is azurerm backend behaviour. PLAN_ONLY = true stops after the plan stage.&lt;br&gt;Grafana provider tokens are literal strings in provider.tf, not pipeline variables. GitVersion, the Wiz IaC scan and release retention come from templates in the external devops-toolset repository." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=9.5;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1099" width="1614" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
