<mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Assumptions &amp;amp; unknowns&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Selective map: individual alert, synthetics and dashboard files are summarised (see pages 2 and 4b). Counts were computed from the supplied zip. Solid = contains; dashed = referenced from code.&lt;br&gt;Terraspace conventions (app/stacks, config/terraform merged at build) are inferred from the layout, Gemfile and pipeline scripts. Terrafile is the unmodified starter template.&lt;br&gt;README.md is a template: it names variable groups example-1 / example-2, while the pipelines use azure-devops-pipeline-network-apps and azure-devops-pipeline-terraform-drift." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=9.5;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="757" width="1129" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
